{"id": "185840", "name": "06 - (x,y,z): x^2-y^2=z^2", "qtype": "truefalse", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 1, "options": {}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\">\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ W = \\{(x,y,z): x^2-y^2=z^2 \\} \\]</p>\n<p>Is <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> a subspace of <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span>?</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"native-answer\">[[input:ans]]</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> We check the three conditions: the zero vector, closure under addition, closure under scalar multiplication.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Zero and scalars</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0^2-0^2=0^2\\)</span>, so <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((0,0,0)\\in W\\)</span>; and <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((\\lambda x)^2-(\\lambda y)^2=\\lambda^2(x^2-y^2)=\\lambda^2z^2=(\\lambda z)^2\\)</span>, so <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> is closed under scalar multiplication.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Addition fails</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u=(1,1,0)\\)</span> and <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v=(1,-1,0)\\)</span> are in <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> (<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1-1=0=0^2\\)</span> in both), but <p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ u+v=(2,0,0),\\qquad 2^2-0^2=4\\neq 0=0^2, \\]</p>so <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u+v\\notin W\\)</span>. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> is not closed under addition, hence not a subspace.\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><b>The statement is false.</b></p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "radio", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "native": {"shuffle": false, "numbering": "none", "instruction": "one", "lang": "en"}}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "native": true, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": []}], "qvnames": [], "nvariants": 1}